  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Paraiba Data Center and Hybrid Broadband Network Project, through ASTRO Systems, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This technical assistance grant provides funding to the Paraiba State Data Processing Company (Companhia de Processamento de Dados da Paraiba, CODATA) for broadband network and data center upgrades in the Brazilian state of Paraiba. Implementation of the project would provide many opportunities for the export of U.S. goods and services.</narrative>
